{"id": 33177, "content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"et\">\n<head>\n <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\">\n <title>Juhiloa terviset\u00f5end samal p\u00e4eval | Valvekliinik Tallinn</title>\n <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Autojuhi terviset\u00f5end Tallinnas - samal p\u00e4eval, ilma saatekirjata. Juhiloa tervisekontroll alates 65 \u20ac. Valvekliinik, \u00dclemiste City.\">\n\n <!-- Open Graph -->\n <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://valvekliinik.ee/juhiluba/\">\n <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Juhiloa terviset\u00f5end samal p\u00e4eval | Valvekliinik Tallinn\">\n <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Autojuhi terviset\u00f5end Tallinnas samal p\u00e4eval. Alates 65 \u20ac. Ilma saatekirjata. Broneerige aeg veebis.\">\n <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Valvekliinik\">\n\n <!-- Fonts -->\n <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n <style>\n  :root {\n   --paper: #F4F1EA;\n   --vein: #5E262C;\n   --tellis: #98544E;\n   --roosa: #E6D3CE;\n   --kivi: #C4BBAE;\n   --ink: #1A1A1A;\n   --white: #FFFFFF;\n   --font: 'Poppins', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html { font-size: 18px; scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n  body { font-family: var(--font); color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); line-height: 1.65; }\n  a { color: var(--vein); text-decoration: none; }\n  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n\n  .container { max-width: 940px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n\n  /* Top bar */\n  .top-bar {\n   background: var(--ink);\n   color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\n   font-size: 0.76rem;\n   padding: 9px 0;\n   text-align: center;\n  }\n  .top-bar a { color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600; }\n  .top-bar .sep { margin: 0 8px; opacity: 0.35; }\n\n  /* Header */\n  .site-header {\n   background: var(--white);\n   border-bottom: 1px solid var(--kivi);\n   padding: 14px 0;\n   position: sticky;\n   top: 0;\n   z-index: 200;\n  }\n  .site-header .container {\n   display: flex;\n   align-items: center;\n   justify-content: space-between;\n   gap: 16px;\n  }\n  .logo-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; }\n  .logo-link img { height: 52px; display: block; }\n  .header-nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }\n  .header-phone { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--ink); }\n  .btn-primary {\n   display: inline-block;\n   background: var(--vein);\n   color: #ffffff;\n   padding: 10px 24px;\n   border-radius: 6px;\n   font-weight: 600;\n   font-size: 0.85rem;\n   text-decoration: none;\n   transition: background 0.18s;\n   white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--tellis); text-decoration: none; }\n\n  /* Hero */\n  .hero {\n   background: var(--white);\n   padding: 68px 0 54px;\n   border-bottom: 1px solid var(--kivi);\n   text-align: center;\n  }\n  .overline {\n   display: inline-block;\n   font-size: 0.68rem;\n   font-weight: 600;\n   letter-spacing: 0.13em;\n   text-transform: uppercase;\n   color: var(--tellis);\n   margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .hero h1 {\n   font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4.5vw, 2.75rem);\n   font-weight: 600;\n   line-height: 1.15;\n   margin-bottom: 18px;\n   letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  }\n  .hero h1 em {\n   font-style: normal;\n   color: var(--vein);\n  }\n  .hero .lead {\n   font-size: 1.05rem;\n   color: var(--tellis);\n   max-width: 500px;\n   margin: 0 auto 30px;\n  }\n  .hero-price-row {\n   margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n  .hero-price {\n   font-size: 2.5rem;\n   font-weight: 600;\n   color: var(--ink);\n   line-height: 1;\n   margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .hero-price-note {\n   font-size: 0.95rem;\n   color: var(--ink);\n   font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .btn-hero {\n   display: inline-block;\n   background: var(--vein);\n   color: #ffffff;\n   padding: 15px 42px;\n   border-radius: 6px;\n   font-weight: 600;\n   font-size: 1rem;\n   text-decoration: none;\n   transition: all 0.18s;\n  }\n  .btn-hero:hover { background: var(--tellis); transform: translateY(-1px); text-decoration: none; }\n  .hero-sub {\n   margin-top: 14px;\n   font-size: 0.82rem;\n   color: var(--kivi);\n  }\n  .hero-sub a { color: var(--vein); font-weight: 600; }\n\n  /* USP strip */\n  .usp-strip {\n   background: var(--ink);\n   padding: 20px 0;\n  }\n  .usp-grid {\n   display: grid;\n   grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n   gap: 8px;\n   text-align: center;\n  }\n  .usp-item { padding: 8px; }\n  .usp-icon { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .usp-label { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; }\n\n  /* Generic section */\n  .section { padding: 56px 0; }\n  .section-white { background: var(--white); }\n  .section-paper { background: var(--paper); }\n  .section-title {\n   font-size: 1.55rem;\n   font-weight: 600;\n   letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n   margin-bottom: 10px;\n   text-align: center;\n  }\n  .section-lead {\n   text-align: center;\n   color: var(--tellis);\n   font-size: 0.9rem;\n   margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  .section-head {\n   text-align: center;\n   margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  .section-head .overline { display: block; }\n\n  /* Exam checks */\n  .exam-grid {\n   display: grid;\n   grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\n   gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .exam-card {\n   background: var(--white);\n   border: 1px solid var(--kivi);\n   border-radius: 10px;\n   padding: 20px 14px;\n   text-align: center;\n  }\n  .exam-card .exam-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .exam-card .exam-name { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.3; }\n\n  /* Categories table */\n  .cat-table-wrap {\n   overflow-x: auto;\n   border-radius: 10px;\n   border: 1px solid var(--kivi);\n   background: var(--white);\n  }\n  .cat-table {\n   width: 100%;\n   border-collapse: collapse;\n   font-size: 0.88rem;\n  }\n  .cat-table th {\n   background: var(--vein);\n   color: #ffffff;\n   padding: 13px 18px;\n   text-align: left;\n   font-weight: 600;\n   font-size: 0.8rem;\n   letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  }\n  .cat-table td {\n   padding: 13px 18px;\n   border-bottom: 1px solid var(--roosa);\n   color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  .cat-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }\n  .cat-table tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #faf8f4; }\n  .cat-badge {\n   display: inline-block;\n   background: var(--roosa);\n   color: var(--vein);\n   border-radius: 4px;\n   padding: 2px 8px;\n   font-size: 0.78rem;\n   font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .notice-box {\n   background: var(--roosa);\n   border-left: 3px solid var(--tellis);\n   border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\n   padding: 14px 18px;\n   font-size: 0.85rem;\n   color: var(--ink);\n   margin-top: 16px;\n  }\n  .notice-box a { color: var(--vein); font-weight: 600; }\n\n  /* Steps */\n  .steps-list {\n   display: flex;\n   flex-direction: column;\n   gap: 0;\n   max-width: 640px;\n   margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .step-row {\n   display: flex;\n   gap: 20px;\n   align-items: flex-start;\n   position: relative;\n   padding-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n  .step-row:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }\n  .step-row:not(:last-child)::after {\n   content: '';\n   position: absolute;\n   left: 20px;\n   top: 44px;\n   bottom: 0;\n   width: 2px;\n   background: var(--roosa);\n  }\n  .step-num {\n   flex-shrink: 0;\n   width: 42px;\n   height: 42px;\n   border-radius: 50%;\n   background: var(--vein);\n   color: #ffffff;\n   font-weight: 600;\n   font-size: 1rem;\n   display: flex;\n   align-items: center;\n   justify-content: center;\n   position: relative;\n   z-index: 1;\n  }\n  .step-body { padding-top: 8px; }\n  .step-body h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--ink); }\n  .step-body p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--tellis); line-height: 1.6; }\n  .step-body a { color: var(--vein); font-weight: 600; }\n  .step-body .step-tag {\n   display: inline-block;\n   font-size: 0.72rem;\n   font-weight: 600;\n   background: var(--roosa);\n   color: var(--vein);\n   border-radius: 4px;\n   padding: 2px 8px;\n   margin-bottom: 8px;\n   text-transform: uppercase;\n   letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n  }\n\n  /* Bring list */\n  .bring-cols {\n   display: grid;\n   grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n   gap: 40px;\n   align-items: start;\n  }\n  .bring-list {\n   list-style: none;\n  }\n  .bring-list li {\n   display: flex;\n   align-items: flex-start;\n   gap: 12px;\n   padding: 12px 0;\n   border-bottom: 1px solid var(--kivi);\n   font-size: 0.88rem;\n   color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  .bring-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n  .check-mark {\n   color: var(--vein);\n   font-weight: 600;\n   flex-shrink: 0;\n   line-height: 1.65;\n  }\n  .info-panel {\n   background: var(--roosa);\n   border-radius: 12px;\n   padding: 26px 22px;\n  }\n  .info-panel h3 {\n   font-size: 0.95rem;\n   font-weight: 600;\n   margin-bottom: 14px;\n   color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  .info-panel p {\n   font-size: 0.85rem;\n   color: var(--tellis);\n   margin-bottom: 10px;\n   line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .info-panel p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .info-panel a { color: var(--vein); font-weight: 600; }\n\n  /* Pricing */\n  .price-cards {\n   display: grid;\n   grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n   gap: 24px;\n   max-width: 640px;\n   margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .price-card {\n   background: var(--white);\n   border: 2px solid var(--kivi);\n   border-radius: 12px;\n   padding: 30px 22px;\n   text-align: center;\n   transition: border-color 0.18s;\n  }\n  .price-card:hover { border-color: var(--vein); }\n  .price-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .price-card .cat-list { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--kivi); margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .price-amount { font-size: 2.1rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--vein); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .price-includes { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--tellis); line-height: 1.55; }\n\n  /* Booking widget */\n  .booking-section { background: var(--paper); padding: 56px 0; }\n  .booking-intro {\n   text-align: center;\n   margin-bottom: 28px;\n  }\n  .booking-note {\n   background: var(--roosa);\n   border-radius: 8px;\n   padding: 14px 20px;\n   font-size: 0.84rem;\n   color: var(--ink);\n   text-align: center;\n   margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .booking-note strong { color: var(--vein); }\n  .booking-widget-wrap {\n   background: var(--white);\n   border-radius: 12px;\n   border: 1px solid var(--kivi);\n   overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .booking-widget-wrap iframe {\n   display: block;\n   width: 100%;\n   height: 620px;\n   border: none;\n  }\n\n  /* FAQ */\n  .faq-list {\n   max-width: 680px;\n   margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .faq-item {\n   background: var(--white);\n   border: 1px solid var(--kivi);\n   border-radius: 10px;\n   margin-bottom: 10px;\n   overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .faq-item summary {\n   padding: 17px 20px;\n   font-weight: 600;\n   font-size: 0.88rem;\n   cursor: pointer;\n   list-style: none;\n   display: flex;\n   justify-content: space-between;\n   align-items: center;\n   color: var(--ink);\n   gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n  .faq-icon {\n   flex-shrink: 0;\n   width: 22px;\n   height: 22px;\n   border-radius: 50%;\n   background: var(--roosa);\n   color: var(--vein);\n   font-size: 1rem;\n   display: flex;\n   align-items: center;\n   justify-content: center;\n   font-weight: 400;\n   line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .faq-item[open] .faq-icon::before { content: '-'; }\n  .faq-icon::before { content: '+'; }\n  .faq-body {\n   padding: 0 20px 18px;\n   font-size: 0.84rem;\n   color: var(--tellis);\n   line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .faq-body a { color: var(--vein); font-weight: 600; }\n\n  /* CTA bottom */\n  .cta-bottom {\n   background: var(--vein);\n   color: #ffffff;\n   padding: 56px 0;\n   text-align: center;\n  }\n  .cta-bottom h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #fff; }\n  .cta-bottom p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); margin-bottom: 26px; }\n  .btn-white {\n   display: inline-block;\n   background: #ffffff;\n   color: var(--vein);\n   padding: 14px 36px;\n   border-radius: 6px;\n   font-weight: 600;\n   font-size: 0.95rem;\n   text-decoration: none;\n   transition: transform 0.18s;\n  }\n  .btn-white:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); text-decoration: none; }\n\n  /* Footer */\n  .site-footer {\n   background: var(--ink);\n   color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n   padding: 32px 0;\n   font-size: 0.8rem;\n  }\n  .footer-inner {\n   display: flex;\n   justify-content: space-between;\n   align-items: flex-start;\n   gap: 24px;\n   flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .footer-col strong { color: #ffffff; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .footer-col a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }\n  .footer-col a:hover { color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline; }\n  .footer-line { margin-bottom: 4px; }\n\n  /* Divider */\n  .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--kivi); margin: 0; }\n\n  /* Mobile */\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n   .header-phone { display: none; }\n   .hero { padding: 44px 0 36px; }\n   .usp-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n   .exam-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }\n   .bring-cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }\n   .price-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n   .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }\n   .booking-widget-wrap iframe { height: 520px; }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n   .exam-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n   .cat-table th, .cat-table td { padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 0.8rem; }\n  }\n </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- Top info bar -->\n<div class=\"top-bar\">\n <span>E-R 9:00-18:00</span>\n <span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>\n <span>L 12:00-16:00</span>\n <span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>\n <span>Riigip\u00fchadel 12:00-16:00</span>\n <span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>\n <a href=\"tel:+37259110909\">+372 5911 0909</a>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Header -->\n<header class=\"site-header\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <a href=\"https://valvekliinik.ee\" class=\"logo-link\">\n   <img src=\"https://valvekliinik.ee/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/vk-logo.svg\" alt=\"Valvekliinik\">\n  </a>\n  <nav class=\"header-nav\">\n   <a href=\"tel:+37259110909\" class=\"header-phone\">+372 5911 0909</a>\n   <a href=\"#broneeri\" class=\"btn-primary\">Broneerige aeg</a>\n  </nav>\n </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- Hero -->\n<section class=\"hero\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <span class=\"overline\">Samal p\u00e4eval - ka laup\u00e4eviti ja p\u00fchade ajal</span>\n  <h1>Juhiloa terviset\u00f5end<br><em>kiirelt ja mugavalt</em></h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Tervisekontroll ja t\u00f5endi v\u00e4ljastamine \u00fchel l\u00fchikesel visiidil. T\u00f5end j\u00f5uab Transpordiametisse automaatselt*.</p>\n  <div class=\"hero-price-row\">\n   <div class=\"hero-price\">alates 65 \u20ac</div>\n   <div class=\"hero-price-note\">Kategooriad A, B, AM, T ja nende alamkategooriad</div>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"#broneeri\" class=\"btn-hero\">Broneerige aeg</a>\n  <p class=\"hero-sub\">V\u00f5i helistage <a href=\"tel:+37259110909\">+372 5911 0909</a></p>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- USP strip -->\n<div class=\"usp-strip\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"usp-grid\">\n   <div class=\"usp-item\">\n    <div class=\"usp-label\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Umbes 20-30 minutit</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"usp-item\">\n    <div class=\"usp-icon\"></div>\n    <div class=\"usp-label\">Samal p\u00e4eval</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"usp-item\">\n    <div class=\"usp-icon\"></div>\n    <div class=\"usp-label\">Ilma saatekirjata</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"usp-item\">\n    <div class=\"usp-label\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">\u00dclemiste City, Tallinn</div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- What is checked -->\n<section class=\"section section-white\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n   <span class=\"overline\">Tervisekontroll</span>\n   <h2 class=\"section-title\">Mida kontrollitakse?</h2>\n   <p class=\"section-lead\">Juhiloa tervisekontroll on l\u00fchike ja terviklik.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"exam-grid\">\n   <div class=\"exam-card\">\n    <div class=\"exam-icon\"></div>\n    <div class=\"exam-name\">Verer\u00f5hk</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"exam-card\">\n    <div class=\"exam-icon\"></div>\n    <div class=\"exam-name\">N\u00e4gemine</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"exam-card\">\n    <div class=\"exam-icon\"></div>\n    <div class=\"exam-name\">Kehamassi indeks (kaal ja pikkus)</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"exam-card\">\n    <div class=\"exam-icon\"></div>\n    <div class=\"exam-name\">Kaela \u00fcmberm\u00f5\u00f5t</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"exam-card\">\n    <div class=\"exam-icon\"></div>\n    <div class=\"exam-name\">Veresuhkur</div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<hr class=\"divider\">\n\n<!-- Driving license categories -->\n<section class=\"section section-white\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n   <span class=\"overline\">Transpordiameti n\u00f5uded</span>\n   <h2 class=\"section-title\">Kategooriad ja kehtivusajad</h2>\n   <p class=\"section-lead\">T\u00f5endi kehtivusaeg s\u00f5ltub juhiloa kategooriast ja Teie vanusest.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cat-table-wrap\">\n   <table class=\"cat-table\">\n    <thead>\n     <tr>\n      <th>Kategooria</th>\n      <th>N\u00e4ited</th>\n      <th>Kehtivus (kuni 65-aastased)</th>\n      <th>Kehtivus (65+ aastased)</th>\n     </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n     <tr>\n      <td><span class=\"cat-badge\">I kategooria</span></td>\n      <td>A, B, AM, T ja alamkategooriad</td>\n      <td>Iga 10 aasta j\u00e4rel</td>\n      <td>Iga 5 aasta j\u00e4rel</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td><span class=\"cat-badge\">II kategooria</span></td>\n      <td>C, D, E ja alamkategooriad</td>\n      <td>Iga 5 aasta j\u00e4rel</td>\n      <td>Iga 5 aasta j\u00e4rel</td>\n     </tr>\n    </tbody>\n   </table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"notice-box\">\n   \u00dcle 65-aastastel juhtidel kehtib terviset\u00f5end k\u00f5ikide kategooriate puhul 5 aastat.\n   Lisateave: <a href=\"https://transpordiamet.ee/tervisetoend-autojuhile\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">transpordiamet.ee/tervisetoend-autojuhile</a>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Steps -->\n<section class=\"section section-paper\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n   <span class=\"overline\">Kuidas see k\u00e4ib</span>\n   <h2 class=\"section-title\">Kolm sammu t\u00f5endini</h2>\n   <p class=\"section-lead\">Protsess on lihtne ja kiire.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"steps-list\">\n   <div class=\"step-row\">\n    <div class=\"step-num\">1</div>\n    <div class=\"step-body\">\n     <span class=\"step-tag\">Enne visiiti</span>\n     <h3>Soovitame t\u00e4ita tervisedeklaratsiooni</h3>\n     <p>Minge <a href=\"https://www.terviseportaal.ee/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">terviseportaal.ee</a> lehele ja t\u00e4itke tervisedeklaratsioon Smart-ID v\u00f5i ID-kaardiga. See on e-terviset\u00f5endi taotlemise esimene samm ning peab olema tehtud enne vastuv\u00f5tule tulekut.</p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"step-row\">\n    <div class=\"step-num\">2</div>\n    <div class=\"step-body\">\n     <span class=\"step-tag\">Visiit</span>\n     <h3>Tulge tervisekontrolli</h3>\n     <p>Tervisekontroll kestab umbes 20-30 minutit. M\u00f5\u00f5dame verer\u00f5hu, n\u00e4gemise, kaal, pikkus, kaela \u00fcmberm\u00f5\u00f5du ja veresuhkru. V\u00f5tke kaasa isikut t\u00f5endav dokument ja prillid (kui kannate). Tulge t\u00fchja k\u00f5huga - s\u00f6\u00f6mata v\u00e4hemalt 2 tundi enne visiiti (vesi on lubatud).</p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"step-row\">\n    <div class=\"step-num\">3</div>\n    <div class=\"step-body\">\n     <span class=\"step-tag\">T\u00f5end</span>\n     <h3>T\u00f5end j\u00f5uab automaatselt Transpordiametisse</h3>\n     <p>T\u00f5end v\u00e4ljastatakse digitaalselt ja j\u00f5uab automaatselt liiklusregistrisse. Paberit ei ole vaja - k\u00f5ik toimub elektrooniliselt. T\u00f5end on kehtiv vahetult p\u00e4rast v\u00e4ljastamist.</p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Bring + exam info -->\n<section class=\"section section-white\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n   <span class=\"overline\">Ettevalmistus</span>\n   <h2 class=\"section-title\">Mida kaasa v\u00f5tta?</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"bring-cols\">\n   <ul class=\"bring-list\">\n    <li>\n     <span class=\"check-mark\"></span>\n     <span>Isikut t\u00f5endav dokument (ID-kaart v\u00f5i pass)</span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n     <span class=\"check-mark\"></span>\n     <span>Prillid v\u00f5i kontaktl\u00e4\u00e4tsed, kui kannate - n\u00e4gemiskontroll toimub nendega</span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n     <span class=\"check-mark\"></span>\n     <span>Soovitavalt t\u00e4idetud tervisedeklaratsioon <a href=\"https://www.terviseportaal.ee/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">terviseportaal.ee</a> kaudu (v\u00f5imalik t\u00e4ita ka kohapeal kliinikus)</span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n     <span class=\"check-mark\"></span>\n     <span>Tulge t\u00fchja k\u00f5huga - mitte s\u00fc\u00fca v\u00e4hemalt 2 tundi enne vastuv\u00f5ttu (vesi on lubatud)</span>\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <div class=\"info-panel\">\n    <h3>Kasulik teada</h3>\n    <p>Tervisedeklaratsioon tuleb t\u00e4ita eelnevalt <a href=\"https://www.terviseportaal.ee/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">terviseportaal.ee</a> kaudu (v\u00f5imalik t\u00e4ita ka kohapeal kliinikus). Ilma t\u00e4idetud deklaratsioonita t\u00f5endit v\u00e4ljastada ei saa.</p>\n    <p>Kui tervisekontrolli k\u00e4igus takistavaid terviseprobleeme ei esine, v\u00e4ljastatakse t\u00f5end samal p\u00e4eval.</p>\n    <p>T\u00f5end j\u00f5uab Transpordiametisse digitaalselt - paberit v\u00f5i eraldi esitamist ei ole vaja.</p>\n    <p>Lisateave: <a href=\"https://transpordiamet.ee/tervisetoend-autojuhile\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">transpordiamet.ee</a></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Pricing -->\n<section class=\"section section-paper\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n   <span class=\"overline\">Hinnakiri</span>\n   <h2 class=\"section-title\">Selge hind, lisatasudeta</h2>\n   <p class=\"section-lead\">Tervisekontroll ja t\u00f5endi v\u00e4ljastamine \u00fches hinnas.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"price-cards\">\n   <div class=\"price-card\">\n    <h3>I kategooria</h3>\n    <div class=\"cat-list\">Kategooriad A, B, AM, T<br>ja nende alamkategooriad</div>\n    <div class=\"price-amount\">65 \u20ac</div>\n    <div class=\"price-includes\">\n     Tervisekontroll + t\u00f5endi v\u00e4ljastamine.<br>\n     Tavap\u00e4rane juhiluba, mootorratas, moped, traktor.\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"price-card\">\n    <h3>II kategooria</h3>\n    <div class=\"cat-list\">Kategooriad C, D, E<br>ja nende alamkategooriad</div>\n    <div class=\"price-amount\">90 \u20ac</div>\n    <div class=\"price-includes\">\n     Laiendatud tervisekontroll + t\u00f5endi v\u00e4ljastamine.<br>\n     Veoauto, buss, haagis - professionaalsed juhikategooriad.\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n  <p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--tellis);margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:2rem;text-align:center;max-width:660px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;line-height:1.6;\">* T\u00f5endi hind on tervisekontrolli konsultatsiooni maksumus. Kui tervislik seisund ei v\u00f5imalda t\u00f5endit v\u00e4ljastada, konsultatsiooni tasu ei tagastata. T\u00f5end v\u00e4ljastatakse ja edastatakse Transpordiametisse ainult juhul, kui tervisekontrolli tulemused seda lubavad.</p>\n\n <!-- Booking widget -->\n<section class=\"booking-section\" id=\"broneeri\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"booking-intro\">\n   <span class=\"overline\"></span>\n   <h2 class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Broneerige aeg</h2>\n   <p class=\"section-lead\">Valige sobiv aeg allpool. Broneerimiseks ei pea Te registreeruma.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"booking-note\">\n   Valige teenus: <strong>\"Tervisekontroll mootors\u00f5idukijuhi terviset\u00f5endi taotlemiseks I kategooria\"</strong> (kat A/B/AM/T)\n   v\u00f5i <strong>\"...II kategooria\"</strong> (kat C/D/E)\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"booking-widget-wrap\">\n   <iframe\n    src=\"https://connectedserver.eu/ConnectedOnlineX/default.aspx?key=XxX0j1C0&lang=et\"\n    title=\"Broneerige tervisekontrolli aeg\"\n    allowfullscreen\n   ></iframe>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:16px; font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--kivi);\">\n   K\u00fcsimused? Helistage <a href=\"tel:+37259110909\" style=\"font-weight:600; color:var(--vein);\">+372 5911 0909</a> v\u00f5i kirjutage <a href=\"mailto:info@valvekliinik.ee\" style=\"color:var(--vein);\">info@valvekliinik.ee</a>\n  </p>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FAQ -->\n<section class=\"section section-white\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n   <span class=\"overline\">Korduma kippuvad k\u00fcsimused</span>\n   <h2 class=\"section-title\">Vastused levinud k\u00fcsimustele</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faq-list\">\n\n   <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>\n     Kas juhiloa terviset\u00f5endit saab samal p\u00e4eval?\n     <span class=\"faq-icon\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"faq-body\">\n     Jah. Kui Te t\u00e4itsite eelnevalt tervisedeklaratsiooni <a href=\"https://www.terviseportaal.ee/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">terviseportaal.ee</a> kaudu (v\u00f5imalik t\u00e4ita ka kohapeal kliinikus) ja tervisekontrolli k\u00e4igus takistusi ei ilmne, v\u00e4ljastatakse t\u00f5end samal p\u00e4eval. T\u00f5end j\u00f5uab Transpordiametisse digitaalselt.\n    </div>\n   </details>\n\n   <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>\n     Kas on vaja saatekirja?\n     <span class=\"faq-icon\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"faq-body\">\n     Ei, saatekirja ei ole vaja. P\u00f6\u00f6rduge otse meie poole - broneerige aeg veebis v\u00f5i helistage +372 5911 0909.\n    </div>\n   </details>\n\n   <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>\n     Mis on tervisedeklaratsioon ja kust seda t\u00e4ita?\n     <span class=\"faq-icon\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"faq-body\">\n     Tervisedeklaratsioon on e-terviset\u00f5endi taotlemise kohustuslik esimene samm. T\u00e4itke see enne visiiti <a href=\"https://www.terviseportaal.ee/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">terviseportaal.ee</a> lehel Smart-ID v\u00f5i ID-kaardiga. Ilma t\u00e4idetud deklaratsioonita terviset\u00f5endit v\u00e4ljastada ei saa.\n    </div>\n   </details>\n\n   <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>\n     Kui kaua juhiloa tervisekontroll aega v\u00f5tab?\n     <span class=\"faq-icon\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"faq-body\">\n     Tervisekontroll kestab umbes 20-30 minutit. Koos ootamisajaga planeerige visiidiks umbes 30 minutit.\n    </div>\n   </details>\n\n   <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>\n     Kas peab tulema t\u00fchja k\u00f5huga?\n     <span class=\"faq-icon\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"faq-body\">\n     Jah. Palume mitte s\u00fc\u00fca v\u00e4hemalt 2 tundi enne vastuv\u00f5ttu, kuna m\u00f5\u00f5dame veresuhkrut. Gaseerimata vesi on lubatud.\n    </div>\n   </details>\n\n   <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>\n     Mis dokumente on vaja kaasa v\u00f5tta?\n     <span class=\"faq-icon\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"faq-body\">\n     V\u00f5tke kaasa isikut t\u00f5endav dokument (ID-kaart v\u00f5i pass) ning prillid v\u00f5i kontaktl\u00e4\u00e4tsed, kui kannate neid tavaliselt. N\u00e4gemiskontroll viiakse l\u00e4bi koos prillide/l\u00e4\u00e4tsedega.\n    </div>\n   </details>\n\n   <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>\n     Kui sageli peab juhiloa terviset\u00f5endit uuendama?\n     <span class=\"faq-icon\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"faq-body\">\n     I kategooria (A, B, AM, T) - iga 10 aasta j\u00e4rel (alla 65-aastastel). II kategooria (C, D, E) - iga 5 aasta j\u00e4rel. \u00dcle 65-aastased juhid peavad t\u00f5endit uuendama k\u00f5ikide kategooriate puhul iga 5 aasta j\u00e4rel.\n    </div>\n   </details>\n\n   <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>\n     Kas laup\u00e4eval saab tervisekontrolli teha?\n     <span class=\"faq-icon\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"faq-body\">\n     Jah. Oleme avatud laup\u00e4eviti kell 12:00-16:00 ning riigip\u00fchadel kell 12:00-16:00. Esmasp\u00e4evast reedeni oleme avatud 9:00-18:00.\n    </div>\n   </details>\n\n   <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>\n     Kuhu t\u00f5end saadetakse?\n     <span class=\"faq-icon\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"faq-body\">\n     T\u00f5end v\u00e4ljastatakse digitaalselt ja j\u00f5uab automaatselt liiklusregistrisse. Te ei pea midagi eraldi esitama - k\u00f5ik toimub elektrooniliselt vahetult p\u00e4rast t\u00f5endi v\u00e4ljastamist.\n    </div>\n   </details>\n\n   <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>\n     Mis juhtub, kui tervisekontrolli k\u00e4igus probleeme avastatakse?\n     <span class=\"faq-icon\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"faq-body\">\n     Kui tervisekontrolli k\u00e4igus ilmneb, et t\u00f5endi v\u00e4ljastamine ei ole v\u00f5imalik, teavitame Teid sellest.<br>\n     Sellisel juhul saame Teid n\u00f5ustada j\u00e4rgmiste sammude osas.<br>\n     Raha tagastamist konsultatsiooni eest ei toimu, kuna tervisekontroll on tehtud.\n    </div>\n   </details>\n\n   <details class=\"faq-item\">\n    <summary>\n     Kas maksta saab pangakaardiga?\n     <span class=\"faq-icon\"></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"faq-body\">\n     Jah, tasuda saab kohapeal nii kaardiga kui sularahas.\n    </div>\n   </details>\n\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- CTA bottom -->\n<section class=\"cta-bottom\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <h2>Valmis juhiloa t\u00f5endit saama?</h2>\n  <p>Broneerige aeg ja saage t\u00f5end k\u00e4tte juba t\u00e4na.</p>\n  <a href=\"#broneeri\" class=\"btn-white\">Broneerige aeg</a>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Footer -->\n<footer class=\"site-footer\">\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n   <div class=\"footer-col\">\n    <strong>Valvekliinik O\u00dc</strong>\n    <div class=\"footer-line\">Sepapaja 12/1, III korrus</div>\n    <div class=\"footer-line\">11415 Tallinn</div>\n    <div class=\"footer-line\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\u00dclemiste Tervisemaja 2 (von Baeri maja)</div>\n    <div class=\"footer-line\">\u00dclemiste City</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"footer-col\">\n    <strong>Lahtiolekuajad</strong>\n    <div class=\"footer-line\">E-R 9:00-18:00</div>\n    <div class=\"footer-line\">L 12:00-16:00</div>\n    <div class=\"footer-line\">Riigip\u00fchadel 12:00-16:00</div>\n    <div class=\"footer-line\">P\u00fchap\u00e4eval suletud</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"footer-col\">\n    <strong>Kontakt</strong>\n    <div class=\"footer-line\"><a href=\"tel:+37259110909\">+372 5911 0909</a></div>\n    <div class=\"footer-line\"><a href=\"mailto:info@valvekliinik.ee\">info@valvekliinik.ee</a></div>\n    <div class=\"footer-line\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\"><a href=\"https://valvekliinik.ee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">valvekliinik.ee</a></div>\n    <div class=\"footer-line\">Reg nr 11576944</div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</footer>\n\n<!-- Schema.org JSON-LD -->\n<script type=\"appli